== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @lime juice{1/4%lime}, @scallions{1/20%cup}, @sesame seeds for topping{}, @gluten-free tamari{1/20%cup}, @ginger paste{1/4%tbsp}, @ground chicken{5/2%oz}, @onion diced i used yellow. white onion works too{1/20%cup}, @maple syrup or honey{1/4%tsp}, @sesame oil{1/4%tbsp}, @garlic{1/2%clove}, @gluten-free Thai sweet chili sauce{1/2%tbsp}, @cilantro{1/20%cup}, @cashews chopped - raw or roasted/salted{3/40%cup}, @cup(s) carrots{}, @romaine lettuce{1/4%head}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare ingredients and any grains or vegetable sides.

Cook protein using an appropriate method until safe doneness, then combine with prepared sauce and garnishes.
